"La repetibilidad de {y} se estimó como la correlación intraclase entre medidas del mismo individuo, r = σ²i / (σ²i + σ²e) ({f}), con los componentes de varianza por {m}{x}. ": "The repeatability of {y} was estimated as the intraclass correlation between measurements of the same individual, r = σ²i / (σ²i + σ²e) ({f}), with variance components estimated by {m}{x}. ",
"La repetibilidad de «{y}» es {n} (r = {r} ± {e}): el {pc} % de la variación entre medidas se debe a diferencias permanentes entre individuos.": "The repeatability of “{y}” is {n} (r = {r} ± {e}): {pc}% of the variation among measurements is due to permanent differences among individuals.",
"La repetibilidad fue r = {r} (EE = {e}); con {m} medidas por individuo, la determinación fue R² = {R}.": "Repeatability was r = {r} (SE = {e}); with {m} measurements per individual, the determination was R² = {R}.",
